<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana July consumer inflation up 8.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Botswana July consumer inflation up 8.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all items consumer price index rose 0.7 percent in July from June, bringing the year-on-year increase to 8.9 percent, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				Jul 1997	 Jun 1997	Jul 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change    8.9		9.0	     10.4</p>
<p>    All-items index     106.6	    105.9	   97.9</p>
<p>Note - Index November 1996 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182  REUTER BB</p>
</text>
